description =
    Lost behind an endless smog of polluted air and endless fog sits the city Drawg. And just like its people, it\n
    is loud and smelly. The sun has such a hard time breaching through the pale grey sky that when it does we\n
    celebrate it. And when we don't, we steal, break stuff, and scream at each other for no reason. Well, some of\n
    us DO have a reason, being survival, like myself, but the rich heads of empowered families, or children of\n
    entitled politicians, more often than not line their pockets without a care in the word. So, we often take it\n
    upon ourselves to make an example of what this place is.
;

response {
    1 = Continue;
}

action {
    1 = SAY tap.;
    1 = WAIT 1000;
    1 = SAY tap..;
    1 = WAIT 1000;
    1 = SAY tap...;
    1 = WAIT 1000;
    1 = GOTO dec_ch1_p2;
}